omx-clap-host (0.25.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * version 0.25.0
  * test-host-verbs: pin_layout answers its declaration, so it is no longer
    pending (#361)
  * test-host-verbs: pin_layout is declared by plugin-hostd 0.15.1, so it is
    checked as declared (#361)
  * chain host sabotage: the lock arms turn red on a probe, not on a race the
    stress may miss (#400)
  * CI takes plugin-hostd from one release, v0.15.1 (#361)
  * CI gives test-host-verbs plugin-hostd's verbs file from the v0.13.0
    checkout (#361)
  * test-host-verbs reads plugin-hostd's verbs file too, and drives chain
    with two members (#361)
  * sabotage arms for the member with a note port (#400): the refusal taken
    back, and the member's note port not made again
  * chain line forms with a member that has a note port (#400)
  * host e2e and docs for the standard clap.params fallback of param_info and
    the remote pages (#391)
  * param_info and the remote pages fall back to the standard clap.params
    when the plugin has no contract or remote controls (#391)

